{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id465545817"}, "name":{"label":"Structured Usr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-25T04:02:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.11"}, "id":{"label":"13439028353"}, "title":{"label":"App Crashing (see Review)"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app, but unable to use on my iPhone. More specifically, here is more context to help you hopefully make an adjustment if you can! \nMy context: \n- iPhone15 Pro Max. \n- IOS 26\n- Coincidently (maybe?) my other app (NextThere) has the exact same issue (see issue below)\n- I click on the app (Structured), the Structured logo (the pink tick) appears in the centre of my screen surrounded by blackness for 1 second then the app crashes. If I click on the app after it crashes the same thing happens, the logo appears then the app crashes. Always the same.\n- I CAN use the app on my MacBook air (without any problem), but my app (on my iPhone) is what I use all the time. I almost never use Structured on my MacBook Air. \n\nI use this app so much. Has helped with my ADHD diagnoses.  If you need anymore info please let me know?! Thanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
