{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1127601521"}, "name":{"label":"Cory R 77"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-23T22:27:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"13177231718"}, "title":{"label":"I have a suggestion"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app downloaded it and then paid for the full version straightaway love how intuitive it is. \n\nOne suggestion though possible section for templates to be inserted? \nthis would change the game dramatically!!!!!\n\nplus If I could select multiple task from a day to duplicate in one go it would make planning even quicker. At the moment I have to go through individual task and duplicate each task which can be tedious.\n\nI want to be able to take the best parts from the days that worked for me previously and replicate those days to echo for my future!!\n\nPlease developers hear me !!🙌🙌🙌🙌", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
