{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id186607491"}, "name":{"label":"Cask Strength W"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-20T21:22:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"13164213419"}, "title":{"label":"Daily driver, ruined."}, "content":{"label":"The new ios26 compliant update for this app has resulted in severe regression in terms of basic performance. Tasks that would take a couple of seconds now require several tries just to get them right. Bugs galore, setting/changing time, viewing whole task and other basic functions have now become a challenge. \n\nThis app has become my default todo app but with these unnecessary UI & functionality changes, I may have to reconsider sticking with a broken app or saving time and moving to something else. \n\nHow can someone manage to destroy a basic working reminder/todo app is beyond my understanding. Hope some updates are in order that will improve functionality rather than just the iOS 26 compliant looks.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
