{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1732010913"}, "name":{"label":"Kashishjain29"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-29T20:51:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"13076932718"}, "title":{"label":"Suggestion"}, "content":{"label":"I really like the free version of the app, although i really want to get the paid version but as a student i don’t want extra cost but even the paid version feels like it might be worth it. Although i have one suggestion that the app can display the reminder on the whole screen and then the user can tap close or anything but the notification is something i usually miss but when it will be on the whole screen its impossible to miss. Additionally, if it is possible to enable that siri can add my task when i ask siri to (don’t know much about technology so at all if it’s possible).", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
