{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id897229326"}, "name":{"label":"Miccy2000"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-13T14:03:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12888204620"}, "title":{"label":"Mostly very useful"}, "content":{"label":"Great app, layout and appearance is usually very user friendly though not without issues.\n\nMajor annoyances are the Premium version regularly forgetting my membership and having to restore my purchase, very frustrating inconsistency with iCloud sync (calendar events import whenever they feel like it, often after I have given up and added them manually) and the desktop version of the app crashes fairly often. \n\nStill love the app and use it daily but would recommend it to way more people if it weren’t for these issues.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id36436827"}, "name":{"label":"abitstrange"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-07T16:53:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12865098663"}, "title":{"label":"Quick Feedback….Thank You"}, "content":{"label":"I recently asked Structured about enabling my events added in Structured to be added in my calendars. At present, unfortunately, this two way sync is not a capability of the app. The Structured team replied promptly: \n\n“Thank you for your review. The two-way sync is not available yet due to technical reasons, but it's on our Roadmap.\"\n\nThat is a pleasing response. I am thrilled to know that it is on their radar and they are going to develop it after working through technical issues. \n\nLooking forward to the changes….Hopefully soon", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
