{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1735135732"}, "name":{"label":"Charlize🎀"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-20T18:09:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"12567510515"}, "title":{"label":"Good"}, "content":{"label":"Structured is a very helpful app that I use on my MacBook and iPhone. It is easy to use and one of the best features is that you can copy a day (routine) and paste it onto another day so you don’t have to individually do every single task.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id681552401"}, "name":{"label":"Loz.1803"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-16T03:58:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"12549464782"}, "title":{"label":"If you have ADHD and hate overwhelming apps, try this"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t ever write reviews but I had to for this app. I’ve tried a large number of other planning and organising apps and this one is by far the best and the only one I’ve actually stuck with. It’s simple, aesthetic and has all of the right features. The visual of it really helps with organisation as it’s not super overwhelming and it’s super customisable. I use it to plan out my days and keep up with my to do list. It is the most helpful thing for me in the mornings as you can set notifications for tasks and for any number of minutes before the task ends which is a lifesaver for time blindness. Helps me feel and stay organised and I love using it and making it look pretty.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id548383054"}, "name":{"label":"Anıl Selim Sürmeli"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-14T02:21:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"12541600287"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful but crucial features missing"}, "content":{"label":"Well designed, beautiful app. Useful bunch of features but I'll unfortunately try another app because:\n\n1. No month view\n2. No Google calendar integration (you can sync google and apple calendars then use apple calendar integration though)\n3. Can't filter items\n4. If I can't complete I want the app to do something for me so that I can fit the same item in another day.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
