{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1216497224"}, "name":{"label":"Alpha_C"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-04T15:13:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"12504212629"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty decent!"}, "content":{"label":"Free version pretty good and usable - especially for a broke student looking for some peace.\nVery reasonable pricing, less then $20 a year - clear and easy to use interface as well as a built in AI system for reordering and all sorts. Imports iCloud calendar very smoothly. Still has minor improvements needed but only in terms of fun additional features. Love how they have this energy bar feature. Much better than money grabbing competitors like Motion! \n\nPlus it’s cute!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
